PARA:
Compressor

An externally controlled continuously variable displacement compressor, the 6SEU14, has been adopted on all models, improving comfort and saving power.

A DL pulley has been adopted on all models. The DL pulley contains a damping mechanism that absorbs compressor torque fluctuations and a limiter mechanism that protects the belt in the unlikely event that the compressor locks. This eliminates the need for the conventional magnetic clutch mechanism. In addition, it is made of resin to reduce weight.
